    {
      "subId": "7370206",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sorush",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "737020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "737020601": {
            "id": "737020601",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "The Tunigi Hollow... this was the epicenter of the disaster. Though all seems calm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020602"
            ]
          },
          "737020602": {
            "id": "737020602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's not hard to think of how things were then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020603"
            ]
          },
          "737020603": {
            "id": "737020603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "These crystals are huge... A lot bigger than even Wenut! And to think it's Sorush's responsibility to handle future problems here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020604"
            ]
          },
          "737020604": {
            "id": "737020604",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "Is this not the most essential duty a Bloomguard should uphold? In addition, Sorush should also expect this of herself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020605"
            ]
          },
          "737020605": {
            "id": "737020605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's what they say, anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020606"
            ]
          },
          "737020606": {
            "id": "737020606",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Do you not trust me? Hmph. I did not realize I was at the stage that even the Pale Floater thinks so little of me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020607"
            ]
          },
          "737020607": {
            "id": "737020607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, Sorush's arrogance makes its grand return!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020608"
            ]
          },
          "737020608": {
            "id": "737020608",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not sure if that's a good thing or a bad thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020609"
            ]
          },
          "737020609": {
            "id": "737020609",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Hmph. Why do both of you still harbor such doubt in me after our time together? My pride has never been born of blind arrogance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020610"
            ]
          },
          "737020610": {
            "id": "737020610",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Hmm. You should be well aware that I fully understand my past mistakes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020611"
            ]
          },
          "737020611": {
            "id": "737020611",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Before, I placed reputation above action, but now, as I have learned, this is an act of purest neglect.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020612"
            ]
          },
          "737020612": {
            "id": "737020612",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Just as Simurgh became the divine bird through her sacrifice, I will become the Bloomguard by my deeds and hear my name rightfully sung in praise of my service.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020613"
            ]
          },
          "737020613": {
            "id": "737020613",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Additionally, I have completed all the assignments you have given me, Elder. Now, even you must admit that I am one worthy of the title of Bloomguard, worthy of the Twin-Horned Chaplet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020614"
            ]
          },
          "737020614": {
            "id": "737020614",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "I indeed have no objection to the choice made by the Khvarena.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020615"
            ]
          },
          "737020615": {
            "id": "737020615",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "...Hm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020616"
            ]
          },
          "737020616": {
            "id": "737020616",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "What? Did you expect me to object?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020617"
            ]
          },
          "737020617": {
            "id": "737020617",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "No... I merely... did not expect you to agree so easily, Elder...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020618"
            ]
          },
          "737020618": {
            "id": "737020618",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I expected a few rough words at least?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020619"
            ]
          },
          "737020619": {
            "id": "737020619",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "Ah, I'm not nearly so vicious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020620"
            ]
          },
          "737020620": {
            "id": "737020620",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "About the responsibilities of a Bloomguard... I did not actually gain any knowledge from the Chaplet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020621"
            ]
          },
          "737020621": {
            "id": "737020621",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Is this because I still do not embody the traits of the Bloomguard fully? Do I still lack training?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020622"
            ]
          },
          "737020622": {
            "id": "737020622",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "For this... The title of Bloomguard might be inherited, but the duties are always variable...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020623"
            ]
          },
          "737020623": {
            "id": "737020623",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020624"
            ]
          },
          "737020624": {
            "id": "737020624",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "To state it simply: there are no fixed rules, and even more, there are no specific judging standards. Usually, the Khvarena's choice is final.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020625"
            ]
          },
          "737020625": {
            "id": "737020625",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Huh? So, you're saying...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020626"
            ]
          },
          "737020626": {
            "id": "737020626",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "I will not be taking the Twin-Horned Chaplet from you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020628",
              "737020630"
            ]
          },
          "737020628": {
            "id": "737020628",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Missing the point!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020633"
            ]
          },
          "737020633": {
            "id": "737020633",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "I understand! This must be part of the test!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020634"
            ]
          },
          "737020634": {
            "id": "737020634",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seems like Sorush is having an epiphany...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020635"
            ]
          },
          "737020635": {
            "id": "737020635",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "You are a forgetful one, Pale Floater. I just said it! To pass these tests, besides competence and observation, the most important thing is understanding my past mistakes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020636"
            ]
          },
          "737020636": {
            "id": "737020636",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Even if the outcome was already determined, would it not be retreading the path of folly if I cast aside all that I have learned during training? So, I think this must be the last test my elder has left me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020637"
            ]
          },
          "737020637": {
            "id": "737020637",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "To a worthy Bloomguard this is but a simple task. This is a sign of your complete trust in me, Elder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020638"
            ]
          },
          "737020638": {
            "id": "737020638",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "I didn't expect you to see right through me. The Khvarena chose well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020639"
            ]
          },
          "737020639": {
            "id": "737020639",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "#But your changes... I suppose {NICKNAME} and Paimon bear some credit for that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020640"
            ]
          },
          "737020640": {
            "id": "737020640",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Indeed! My esteemed Yasnapati and the Pale Floater are both beings of merit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020641"
            ]
          },
          "737020641": {
            "id": "737020641",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Though I wish to say that I am potent enough alone... I believe that with their aid, the extinguishing of the Sign of Apaosha will be no difficult task.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020642"
            ]
          },
          "737020642": {
            "id": "737020642",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "How very reliable. Don't forget, Mihir and Rashnu will also be able to assist you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020643"
            ]
          },
          "737020643": {
            "id": "737020643",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Worry not, Elder! Leave everything to me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020644"
            ]
          },
          "737020644": {
            "id": "737020644",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon keeps thinking that Zurvan might have planned this... But seeing Sorush this happy, Paimon can't really complain."
          },
          "737020630": {
            "id": "737020630",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, as Zurvan said herself, the Khvarena's choice is final. That means that Zurvan can't change it either, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020631"
            ]
          },
          "737020631": {
            "id": "737020631",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "Oh, ho ho... You really think so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020632"
            ]
          },
          "737020632": {
            "id": "737020632",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... That's a little scary..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
