          },
          "737020733": {
            "id": "737020733",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seems like Sorush is having an epiphany...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020734"
            ]
          },
          "737020734": {
            "id": "737020734",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "You are a forgetful one, Pale Floater. I just said it! To pass these tests, besides competence and observation, the most important thing is understanding my past mistakes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020735"
            ]
          },
          "737020735": {
            "id": "737020735",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Even if the outcome was already determined, would it not be retreading the path of folly if I cast aside all that I have learned during training? So, I think this must be the last test my elder has left me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020736"
            ]
          },
          "737020736": {
            "id": "737020736",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "To a worthy Bloomguard this is but a simple task. This is a sign of your complete trust in me, Elder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020737"
            ]
          },
          "737020737": {
            "id": "737020737",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "I didn't expect you to see right through me. The Khvarena chose well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020738"
            ]
          },
          "737020738": {
            "id": "737020738",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "#But your changes... I suppose {NICKNAME} and Paimon bear some credit for that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020739"
            ]
          },
          "737020739": {
            "id": "737020739",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Indeed! My esteemed Yasnapati and the Pale Floater are both beings of merit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020740"
            ]
          },
          "737020740": {
            "id": "737020740",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Though I wish to say that I was potent enough alone... I think, truly, that only with their aid could I extinguish the Sign of Apaosha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020741"
            ]
          },
          "737020741": {
            "id": "737020741",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "I didn't think that, in so short a time, Sorush could become so responsible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020742"
            ]
          },
          "737020742": {
            "id": "737020742",
            "speakerId": 13210,
            "speakerName": "Sorush",
            "text": "Of course! As long as I hold my responsibilities close to heart, then my elder need not worry for my sake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020743"
            ]
          },
          "737020743": {
            "id": "737020743",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon keeps thinking that Zurvan might have planned this... But seeing Sorush this happy, Paimon can't really complain."
          },
          "737020729": {
            "id": "737020729",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, as Zurvan said herself, the Khvarena's choice is final. That means that Zurvan can't change it either, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020730"
            ]
          },
          "737020730": {
            "id": "737020730",
            "speakerId": 4284,
            "speakerName": "Zurvan",
            "text": "Oh, ho ho... You really think so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "737020731"
            ]
          },
          "737020731": {
            "id": "737020731",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... That's a little scary..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}